Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): reject torn reserved-key uniqueness scans
 [daveey]

Pin snapshot head across all pages and require tasks table identity. Preserve preview/apply refusal with no writes and the original malformed-envelope/cursor coverage. Proof: old source 5 failing regressions with 2 positive controls; updated 8-file recovery/sync suites 882 passed; scripts/check --base origin/main passed; four guard mutations killed by eligibility assertions. Addresses independent review 5951573377.
